{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Kemet X</i>, play as warrior-prince Jaraqo. Command your spacecraft across distant stars, face off against powerful galactic overlords, and carve your path to kingship. Designed as a <strong>short game</strong>, each episode of the <i>Kemet X</i> series will unveil a new stage in Jaraqo\u2019s epic journey, pushing you deeper into the cosmos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/Space_Combat.gif?t=1740738461\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in an alternate history where the empires of Kemet (Ancient Egypt) remained unconquered, Kemet X blends African history with Afro-futurism for a unique narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/Jaraqo_Combat.gif?t=1740738461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available on PC and VR via Virtual Desktop, <i>Kemet X</i> offers a truly immersive experience. While in VR, play seamlessly using an Xbox controller or keyboard. For the ultimate gameplay, enjoy <i>Kemet X</i> on a large screen in VR via Virtual Desktop, with an Ethernet connection for peak performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/400E4FCD-5086-4A10-BE7F-0D32936910A7__1_.jpg?t=1740738461\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Support the journey by wishlisting Kemet X on Steam today.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/Jaraqo_s_Dream.jpg?t=1740738461\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For fans of films like <i>Black Panther</i> and <i>The Woman King</i></strong>: Immerse yourself in a rich, story-driven adventure inspired by Afrocentric narratives and epic storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A solo-developed creation</strong>: Crafted by indie developer Theo Dusu, <i>Kemet X</i> delivers a captivating journey with an unforgettable ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging and focused gameplay</strong>: A short yet impactful game that combines compelling storytelling with thrilling hand-to-hand combat and dynamic space combat sequences.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2552770?t=1740738461","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2552770?t=1740738461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/01417d31a8dd42b2d36a3ae833a161c856762a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740738461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/01417d31a8dd42b2d36a3ae833a161c856762a36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740738461","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Kemet X</i>, play as warrior-prince Jaraqo. Command your spacecraft across distant stars, face off against powerful galactic overlords, and carve your path to kingship. Designed as a <strong>short game</strong>, each episode of the <i>Kemet X</i> series will unveil a new stage in Jaraqo\u2019s epic journey, pushing you deeper into the cosmos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552770/extras/Space_Combat.gif?t=1740738461\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in an alternate history where the empires of Kemet (Ancient Egypt) 